  "description": "\nSHARED FAMILY ACCOMMODATION \nPRICES RANGE FROM €875 - €1150 \n\nNewly Renovated Family Accommodation – Castle Street, Ardee\n\nA newly renovated property in the heart of Ardee town, providing comfortable and convenient family accommodation.\n\nThe property has been specially renovated to provide comfortable accommodation for Ukrainian families, with spacious communal facilities, all utility bills and Wi-Fi included.\n\nProperty Features\n\n• Variety of room sizes suitable for different family requirements\n• Large communal kitchen, fully equipped for shared use\n• Spacious communal dining room\n• Recreation room – a comfortable space to relax and socialise\n• Laundry room\n• Secure outdoor courtyard\n• All utility bills included\n• Wi-Fi included\n\nExcellent Schools Nearby\n\nThe property is in walking distance to three primary schools and one secondary school \n\nFitness & Wellness\n\nArdee town centre is home to three gyms, offering a wide range of fitness facilities and classes, including Reformer Pilates and yoga, providing plenty of options for staying active and enjoying a healthy lifestyle.\n\nSport & Family Facilities\n\nNearby amenities include a children’s playground, soccer facilities and Ardee Athletic Club, providing excellent opportunities for both children and adults to enjoy sport, recreation and outdoor activities.\n\nThe property is also beside Illusionz Aerial & Gymnastics Studio, offering convenient access to gymnastics, aerial and recreational activities.\n\nExcellent Transport Links\n\nBus stops are conveniently located nearby, with direct routes to Dundalk, Drogheda and Dublin, making it an ideal base for commuters, workers and families.\n\nLocal Amenities\n\nResidents have easy access to supermarkets, pharmacies, bakeries, cafés, restaurants and other essential services, all within easy reach.\n\n\nPlease get in touch for further information or to arrange a viewing.",
